Subject: Naive question about random year effects and initial values (Multivent model)
Message-ID: <R6IYIN6qMxs.QA2xl_WxAQAJ@nimble-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/nimble-users/c/R6IYIN6qMxs/m/QA2xl_WxAQAJ>
